cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Monte Carlo model of the coupled air–sea system for the LUCE spaceborne lidar mission"
abstract: >-
  Fortran 90 Monte Carlo radiative transfer model of the lidar signal of a
  spaceborne ocean lidar, including the wind-roughened air-sea interface
  (Cox-Munk slopes with Smith shadowing), surface glint, Gaussian beam
  illumination and a finite receiver field of view. Presented at the AISAM
  Students' Conference 2026 (Festival della Meteorologia, Rovereto).
authors:
